{"role": "assistant", "content": "HR Business Partners (HRBPs) play a compliance and approval role. They ensure the offer follows compensation bands and local labor laws and finalize the benefits language\u202f[chunk\u20115]. In the automated decision matrix, the HRBP must co\u2011sign off on offers when the candidate score is between\u202f3.0\u202fand\u202f4.0 **or** the proposed compensation falls between the band midpoint\u202f+\u202f10\u202f% and\u202f+\u202f25\u202f%\u202f[chunk\u20119]."}
