{"role": "assistant", "content": "Besides the HR Business Partner, the following individuals or groups are involved in the HR process (compensation compliance, benefits language, etc.):\n\n- Hiring managers \u2013 evaluate candidates and set objectives\u3010chunk\u20115\u3011  \n- Recruiters / Talent Acquisition \u2013 manage candidate communications and prepare the initial offer package\u3010chunk\u20115\u3011  \n- People Ops specialists \u2013 build onboarding curricula and maintain the playbook\u3010chunk\u20113\u3011  \n- Legal \u2013 participates in offer approvals and ensures compliance\u3010chunk\u20113\u3011  \n- Finance \u2013 signs off on salary amounts that exceed the band midpoint\u202f+\u202f15%\u3010chunk\u20115\u3011  \n\nThese roles work together with the HRBP to ensure the process meets compensation and benefits requirements."}
