{"role": "assistant", "content": "The pragmatic playbook requires that the legal\u2011 and commercial\u2011alignment step\u202f1 include:\n\n* **Confirming the target SLOs** for the customer, the **billing model** (whether usage\u2011based or reserved capacity), and the **trial period** that will be offered\u202f[chunk-12].  \n* **Documenting all commitments** in the contract appendix, explicitly capturing **fallback and rollback terms**\u202f[chunk-12].  \n\nThe playbook is intended to be used **when contracting customers for dedicated or private deployments** (and when migrating high\u2011usage tenants from hosted to dedicated), so these contract and compliance items are built into the onboarding process\u202f[chunk-2]."}
