{"role": "assistant", "content": "The document maps each stakeholder group to a specific ownership or contact field:\n\n* **Product managers and solutions engineering** \u2013 covered by the **product owner** (who has overall decision authority) and by the **Solutions Engineer** listed under customer\u2011success contacts.\u202f[chunk\u201120]  \n\n* **Customer\u2011success and account teams** \u2013 represented by the **account lead** and the **Solutions Engineer** recorded in the customer record.\u202f[chunk\u201120]  \n\n* **Platform and runtime engineers** \u2013 addressed by the **runtime owner** (the Eng\u2011serving\u2011runtime on\u2011call channel) and the **SRE** rotation contacts.\u202f[chunk\u201120]  \n\nThese groups are also called out as the intended audience for the playbook.\u202f[chunk\u20114]"}
