$1672
{"role": "assistant", "content": "The playbook is a **pragmatic onboarding guide** that maps a customer\u2019s latency, availability and correctness\u202fSLOs to the appropriate fidelity tier, specifies the telemetry that must be collected, lists the operational checks to run, and provides a step\u2011by\u2011step checklist for both commercial and technical leads\u202f[chunk\u20112].  \n\nIt is intended for **commercial and technical stakeholder groups** (e.g., commercial leads, engineering leads, and customer\u2011success teams) who are contracting dedicated or private deployments or migrating high\u2011usage tenants from hosted to dedicated environments\u202f[chunk\u20112].\n\n**Ownership / contact fields for the configuration artifacts** are listed in the required\u2011configs table:\n\n| Template | Location | Purpose | Owner |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| fidelity\u2011profile.json | /catalog/fidelity\u2011defs | Defines quant, batch, cache settings | **eng\u2011serving\u2011runtime** |\n| onboarding\u2011checklist.md | /playbooks/onboarding | Customer\u2011facing checklist | **customer\u2011success** |\n| sampling\u2011config | redwood\u2011routing flags | Telemetry sampling for pre\u2011rollout | **eng\u2011platform** |\n\nThese owners serve as the contact points for each group\u202f[chunk\u201118].\n\n**Key operational and legal/commercial alignment steps** in the checklist are:\n\n1. **Legal / Commercial alignment** \u2013 confirm the target SLOs, choose the billing model (usage vs. reserved), and agree on any trial period.  \n2. Document all commitments in the CD/contract appendix, including fallback and rollback terms\u202f[chunk\u201112]."}
